'''Coated in Azurite''' is a [[debuff]] applied by [[spider|spiders]] in the [[Azurite Mine]]. It can stack multiple times and has a timer. It deals [[cold damage]] [[damage over time|over time]] as well as reduces [[movement speed]].

==See also==
* [[Covered in Webs]], another spider debuff
* [[Covered in Spiders]], a debuff applied by [[Hybrid Widow]] unique boss

